OL,3,GNEWSAFamily wins high court bid over
OL,4,Afatal club stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA High Court judge has granted the
OL,7,Ffamily of a man stabbed to death in a
OL,8,Fnightclub, permission to challenge a
OL,9,Fdecision not to seek to overturn a
OL,10,Fman's acquittal.
OL,12,FIt comes after the Director of Public
OL,13,FProsecutions' decided not to apply to
OL,14,Fthe Court of Appeal to overturn the
OL,15,Facquittal of a man in connection with
OL,16,Fthe killing.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
