OL,3,GNEWSAFamily wins high court bid over
OL,4,Afatal club stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyan Passey, 24, died from a single
OL,7,Fstab wound at Chicago's nightclub in
OL,8,FStourbridge on 6 August 2017. The man
OL,9,Ftried for murder was cleared by a jury
OL,10,Fin 2018. A subsequent civil case ruled
OL,11,Fthat Passey had been unlawfully killed.
OL,13,FEmotions ran high in court, with tears
OL,14,Fvisible in the public gallery after the
OL,15,Fjudge granted a full hearing. His
OL,16,Ffather, Adrian Passey, said although
OL,17,Fthey did not expect the decision, it
OL,18,Fwas a welcomed one.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
